        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this bedroom for rent in a shared property located in the quiet and popular development of Ashfield Grove, Hunstown, Dublin 15.\nThe property is ideally located close to a range of local amenities including shops, schools, parks and excellent transport links with easy access to Dublin City Centre, the M50 and Dublin Airport.\nAccommodation briefly comprises of a bright and spacious living area, fully fitted kitchen with dining space, shared bathroom and a well-maintained rear garden. The bedroom is fully furnished and presented in excellent condition throughout.\n\nAdditional features include:\n• Fully furnished bedroom\n• Modern fitted kitchen\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Parking available\n• Quiet residential area\n\nViewing is highly advised. Contact RAY COOKE LETTINGS today to arrange a viewing"
      },
